WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.985
A subquery in SELECT must behave like a scalar for
each output row If

00:00:06.011 --> 00:00:11.686
it is uncorrelated the same value may repeat If it
is correlated

00:00:11.884 --> 00:00:17.456
the value can change from row to row This placement
is useful when you want

00:00:17.469 --> 00:00:20.219
to enrich each row with one related summary value
